sequenceDiagram
    participant Guest as WASM guest code
    participant SDK as nx-sdk wrapper and FFI import
    participant Memory as WASM linear memory
    participant Host as nx-core Host API
    Guest->>SDK: Call byte-oriented wrapper
    SDK->>Memory: Hold input and reserve output buffer
    SDK->>Host: nx import with ptr, len, out_ptr, out_cap
    Host->>Memory: Validate bounds and read input
    Host->>Host: Perform host operation
    Host->>Memory: Write output within capacity
    Host-->>SDK: Return byte count or error code (i32)
    SDK->>Memory: Read output on success
    SDK-->>Guest: Return value or error
